   </div>
   <div id="ftn6">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref6" name="_ftn6" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[6]</span></span></a> [1912] A.C. 673.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn7">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref7" name="_ftn7" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[7]</span></span></a> [1919] 2 K.B. 581.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn8">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref8" name="_ftn8" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[8]</span></span></a> [1949] 3 D.L.R. 51.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn9">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref9" name="_ftn9" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[9]</span></span></a> [1967] 1 W.L.R. 104.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn10">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref10" name="_ftn10" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[10]</span></span></a> [1964] A.C. 40.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn11">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref11" name="_ftn11" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[11]</span></span></a> [1964] A.C. 40.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn12">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref12" name="_ftn12" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[12]</span></span></a> [1957] A.C. 488.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn13">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref13" name="_ftn13" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[13]</span></span></a> [1974] 3 All E.R. 327.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn14">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref14" name="_ftn14" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[14]</span></span></a> (1971), 18 D.L.R. (3d) 374.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn15">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref15" name="_ftn15" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[15]</span></span></a> [1975] 1 S.C.R. 376.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn16">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref16" name="_ftn16" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[16]</span></span></a> [1972] Ch. 305.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn17">
    <p class="MsoFootnoteText"><a href="#_ftnref17" name="_ftn17" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[17]</span></span></a> (1972), 92 S. Ct. 2694.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn18">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref18" name="_ftn18" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[18]</span></span></a> (1972), 92 S. Ct. 2701.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn19">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref19" name="_ftn19" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[19]</span></span></a> [1963] 2 O.R. 257.</p>
   </div>
   <div id="ftn20">
    <p class="Para"><a href="#_ftnref20" name="_ftn20" title=""><span class="MsoFootnoteReference"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">[20]</span></span></a> [1936] 3 All E.R. 322.</p>
